From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 11:27:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(inventory): replay the first player inventory click

Java can open its inventory before Bedrock acknowledges OpenInventory. Queue those early clicks and replay them in order once the Bedrock container opens, with bounded queueing and a timeout that resynchronizes the Java view.
---
 .../protocol/packet/InventoryPackets.java     | 48 +++++++-----
 .../storage/InventoryRequestTracker.java      | 78 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../storage/InventoryRequestTrackerTest.java  | 68 ++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 175 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/test/java/net/raphimc/viabedrock/protocol/storage/InventoryRequestTrackerTest.java

